     "label": "例 3",
     "ref": "L10 Ex 3",
     "question": "Find the inverse relations of: (a) y = 2x + 6 (b) f(x) = {{frac −1|2x + 3}}",
     "solution": "(a) 交换：x = 2y + 6，解出 y = {{frac x − 6|2}}。\n(b) 交换：x = {{frac −1|2y + 3}}，2y + 3 = −{{frac 1|x}}，2y = −{{frac 1|x}} − 3，y = −{{frac 1 + 3x|2x}}。\n验证 (b)：f(1) = −1/5；代入逆关系 x = −1/5：−(1 − 3/5)/(−2/5) = 1，回到原来的 1。",
     "answer": "(a) y = (x − 6)/2 (b) y = −(1 + 3x)/(2x)",
