     "ref": "L10 Ex 5",
     "question": "Sketch the graphs of the inverse relations for each function shown: (a) a line with y-intercept 2 and x-intercept 8; (b) a curve through (1, 0) rising slowly, with the negative y-axis as asymptote; (c) the horizontal line y = 3; (d) a parabola with x-intercepts 0 and 4 and vertex (2, −2); (e) a quarter arc from the negative x-axis to (0, 2) followed by a line from (0, 2) to (2, 0); (f) a curve dipping below the x-axis on the left, passing through the origin and meeting y = x again in the first quadrant.",
     "solution": "方法：把关键点 (a, b) 换成 (b, a)，再沿 y = x 翻折整条曲线（红线是逆关系）。\n(a) 截距 (0, 2)、(8, 0) 变成 (2, 0)、(0, 8)：y = 8 − 4x。\n(b) (1, 0) 变成 (0, 1)；竖直渐近线（负 y 轴）变成水平渐近线（负 x 轴）：形状像 y = eˣ。\n(c) 水平线 y = 3 变成竖直线 x = 3，逆关系不是函数。\n(d) (2, −2) 变成 (−2, 2)，截距 (4, 0) 变成 (0, 4)：开口向右的抛物线 x = ½y² − 2y，不是函数。\n(e) 线段 y = 2 − x 关于 y = x 对称，翻折后不变；弧从 (−1.25, 0)…(0, 2) 变成 (0, −1.25)…(2, 0)。\n(f) 原图左边先降后升，同一个 y 有两个 x，所以逆关系在左下方「侧着」打弯，不是函数；原图与 y = x 的两个交点（原点和第一象限那一点）逆关系也经过。",
